Visualisation Tool For The Travelling Salesman Problem - Annealing Methods
By Drew   9/97           V1.01

Usage: E:\WATCOM\TSP\TSPANN.EXE viewfile temp cool changes [time]
Where  viewfile= the file to run annealing on
       temp    = the starting temperature
       cool    = the cooling rate (0.0 < rate < 1.0)
       changes = the number of changes to make at each temperature
       time    = 0 is calculate to end
       time    = n is take n 10ths of seconds for each insert
       time    =-2 is Benchmark Mode - Simply returns length
       time    =-3 optimal is Benchmark for all methods,
                              with optimal calculation
       No time = wait for keypress between each optimize step
